<title>Somalia: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/somalia/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-somalia-2026-10-27T06:30:05.530Z</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 27 Oct 2026 06:30:05 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Fitgharan forces now hold the Mogadishu-Baidoa corridor while Laftagareen forces have taken Buurhakaba and a town in Bay, extending combat in southern Somalia. Al Shabaab detonated an IED in Mandera, injuring six civilians, and Somali intelligence killed a senior al Shabaab operative. Heavy fighting erupted near Baidoa and in Burijeed as Laftagareen forces attacked army positions, prompting UN calls to halt the fighting amid famine, displacement and flood risks. Ethiopia has withdrawn more than 3,000 troops and will not intervene in the South West State conflict. 2,284 battle-related deaths were recorded in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiV0FVX3lxTE9lRnAyWFN6S1Q2cWx6b2pXZk1IblNMX3g0d1lpRXhqYWFPdnp4R3ctUmlnQlcyeUlJM3lldzFKVW9WdENxc21uUm9xOUg2Sy1PYV80U2VvWQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimgFBVV95cUxPc0x4OF8wRmZ1bXpWV0ZQSnYybHJMSF81Q3NFUEVKa0piSzRJQkNGMXl3TmUxQlJZb181ZDZzRGkxVkpia3ZLd0VmQlFxeWNaZ01jYU5EbWQ3ampYeWFuSnpraVBMVzlCQ0hNaXhXSm5yc0d3M2h2NFBVSzR1Tm52dk4wdGNmbGJIVFVBM3lZZUtTdm8wVVBXcThB?oc=5&quot;&gt;Somali Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiswFBVV95cUxQSVk5c1Q3X1BKU0h0dXZJUTNOaVpSR080QkhuOEJFbHYyeWctbTJXYVVKbHpVY0FoZFhNQ2xFRjRKeVdTNmRDbzZOWlQyRHFseGtWXzd2ZHM3amxGcjl3ZWpTYnNHTjhzOEdtYW5EVlo4TDZySkNiSGtTNGUxZzJqc1A3ZDdJY1Ztc1p3eTB3Sy03MHRPcTlhdHJLbTdWcnVaMk9pZG1SVjgyRktNa21nN0lZSQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijgFBVV95cUxNY3B6Z0JTNGhFbzNCanhMNVh4bTVsMFpWWU5VenFYYmdyR2NXenNiZkt1S1dKaFZDYWVVdTlwOVpsWDR3UmpHYVdMQU40elJwcmZ2ZXpaOGhNT2FXUnpScWRvZGI1VGZiN0JrWFQ4LUF5NWZnYndJWm9fN2FieEdJbm56ekZVcmhUaktIcUFR?oc=5&quot;&gt;Somali Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;